{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Joanna! How've you been? Been a busy week since we talked."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-d17c5863ce054d8b0ad29571", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:09.912010+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d17c5863ce054d8b0ad29571", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d17c5863ce054d8b0ad29571", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate! Just finished something - pretty wild journey!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-73f85f972bae099d276894d4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:09.945615+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "73f85f972bae099d276894d4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "73f85f972bae099d276894d4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Way to go! I just got a new addition to the family, this is Max!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-137a067fb7ad20c12e4ab3e6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:09.966645+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "137a067fb7ad20c12e4ab3e6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "137a067fb7ad20c12e4ab3e6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow, he's adorable! How long have you had him? I can see why you're thrilled!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-4dde9d25184466b7016c68b5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:09.992947+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4dde9d25184466b7016c68b5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4dde9d25184466b7016c68b5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Thanks! It's awesome - he's adopted and so full of energy, and he's filling my life with so much joy. He's even keeping my other pets active."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-146de488edfce2c20aeac353", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.012739+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "146de488edfce2c20aeac353", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "146de488edfce2c20aeac353", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Pets sure do make life better! Glad Max is bringing you lots of joy."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-9703e3fc7e6f782356001610", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.030656+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9703e3fc7e6f782356001610", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9703e3fc7e6f782356001610", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Yep, totally! Pets make us so much happier and never let us down. Have you thought any more of getting one of your own?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-de311925f7315d9f54fb2623", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.051366+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "de311925f7315d9f54fb2623", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "de311925f7315d9f54fb2623", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Unfortunately, allergies make it so I don't really want to get any, and I'm too lazy to research alternative pets for my allergies."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-ee14fd19dbecda3fd7ebc653", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.068092+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ee14fd19dbecda3fd7ebc653", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ee14fd19dbecda3fd7ebc653", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Aww, that's unfortunate. It's nice seeing the joy pets bring to others, though. How do you find comfort when you don't have any?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-f66f156095a8c710d5216ad1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.085891+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f66f156095a8c710d5216ad1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f66f156095a8c710d5216ad1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Writing and creative projects are what get me through tough times. I'm also grateful for my supportive friends."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-4aa454f1c64e4cd98e8234fc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.105352+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4aa454f1c64e4cd98e8234fc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4aa454f1c64e4cd98e8234fc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Wow, that's awesome! Those both can definitely be therapeutic. It's great to have such positive relationships that make such a great impact."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-3385c30d77276ed10e8e2b44", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.121774+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3385c30d77276ed10e8e2b44", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3385c30d77276ed10e8e2b44", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Yeah. It's so nice to have friends who understand and appreciate my work - it's priceless being able to talk about it together and receive feedback. Here's a look at what I've been working on \u2013 it's been quite a journey, but I made it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-0fb2fe0721ef9b48b2a71197", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.140232+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0fb2fe0721ef9b48b2a71197", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0fb2fe0721ef9b48b2a71197", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Wow, that looks great Joanna! Is that your third one?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-7f969e66fc8817d304ffcb13", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.161926+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7f969e66fc8817d304ffcb13", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7f969e66fc8817d304ffcb13", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Yep! I chose to write about this because it's really personal. It's about loss, identity, and connection. It's a story I've had for ages but just got the guts to write it. It was hard, but I'm so proud of it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-feb2b67d0ddfc171745d1192", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.173817+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "feb2b67d0ddfc171745d1192", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "feb2b67d0ddfc171745d1192", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That sounds impressive. You really do like writing about sadness and loss don't you."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-2fdaffd8ef5d98a4a0f9c0af", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.202072+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2fdaffd8ef5d98a4a0f9c0af", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2fdaffd8ef5d98a4a0f9c0af", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! Yeah I really do. I had to be vulnerable and dig deep into those topics. But I think meaningful stories come from personal experiences and feelings. It was scary, but I found that I write best when I'm being true to myself - even if it's hard."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-98d614304c5c156d3333364c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.220965+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "98d614304c5c156d3333364c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "98d614304c5c156d3333364c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Well done, Joanna! It takes guts to explore your experiences and feelings. I'm proud of you for staying strong and being true to yourself. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-22c17d89a1935644870f2b51", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.242193+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "22c17d89a1935644870f2b51", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "22c17d89a1935644870f2b51", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! Your support really means a lot. Knowing I've got people like you cheering me on makes this journey way easier."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-1f5cf46fb69b13b1d664df69", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.264510+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1f5cf46fb69b13b1d664df69", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1f5cf46fb69b13b1d664df69", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: No worries, Joanna! Keep going and reach for your dreams. You've got tons of talent and potential!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-42/session_12-908433fbaa0c43b9a86625c2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:22:10.283922+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "908433fbaa0c43b9a86625c2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "908433fbaa0c43b9a86625c2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
